{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9b4c8eab-ac66-881f-80ed-679274745eb9",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:51:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ellen Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:47:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:47:28-05:00",
      "duration": 40,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Ellen Gardiner and I'm at 151 Admiral Kalbfus Road in the North End, and the storm drain on the corner by my house is full right up to the top with water and it's not draining at all, it's been that way since the nor'easter Friday and Saturday, three days ago, and I called a while back about that same drain and somebody told me it was a state road so it wasn't the city's, and I didn't know who to call after that, so I'm calling to ask who I should call to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:48:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me make sure I've got that. 151 Admiral Kalbfus Road, and the drain is at the corner, not right in front of your house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:48:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at the corner, yes, the one on the corner just down from my driveway. The water is sitting there level with the grate. Nothing's going down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:48:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And you were told before that it's a state road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:48:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's what I was told on the phone. I don't remember who it was. They said it was the state's road and the state handles the drains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:48:48-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, part of that can be true. Some of the roads out your way are state-maintained, and the drains on them belong to the state, not us. I can't tell from here which one this is, so I'd rather look at the map than tell you wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:49:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you hold for me for a minute? I'll pull up the road list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:49:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:49:17-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, thanks for waiting. So the stretch by you is a state road, you were told right. The state Department of Transportation maintenance office is who takes drain reports on it. That's not something we can send a crew to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:49:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. And is there a number for them, or is there some way you can report it for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 32,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you a number off the top, I don't want you writing down something wrong. The easiest thing is to look up the state DOT maintenance line, they have a report-a-problem option. But I'll also put a note in our system here with your address and that the drain is full and not moving, so if our people drive by they'll know. And if water starts coming up into the road or toward your house, call us back right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:50:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. It's not in the house or anything, the water's just standing in the street at the corner. I just want it looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:50:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Is the road passable?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:50:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, cars are going through it slowly. It's a big puddle really, all across the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:50:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you want me to put your callback number on the note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:50:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0179."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:50:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0179. Got it. And your name is Ellen Gardiner, G-A-R-D-I-N-E-R?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:50:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, with an E-R at the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:50:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I've got it noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:50:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I have to get going, I'm going to look at a secondhand piano that somebody has for sale nearby, and I'd like to get there before someone else does."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:51:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good luck with that. Thanks for calling, Mrs. Gardiner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T08:51:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, goodbye."
    }
  ],
